# special, is always there (lobster_stand_moves.gd).
# Stats: "block_reflect" (added to the share a blocked hit sends back), "max_health". Unlocks: "molt".
# Generated by Claude Code.
class_name LobsterStandSkillTree
extends DefaultStandSkillTree


func _init() -> void:
